        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Natalie Wood, Warren Beatty, Jerome Robbins, Zohra Lampert\n- Films: Splendor in the Grass, Alphabet City\n- Roles: Johnny's mother\n\nFacts:\n- In 1961, Zohra Lampert starred alongside Natalie Wood and Warren Beatty in the film \"Splendor in the Grass.\"\n- \"Splendor in the Grass\" was directed by Jerome Robbins.\n- The New York Times described Jerome Robbins as \"one of the most honored and influential directors in Broadway and Hollywood history.\"\n- Zohra Lampert played Johnny's mother in the film \"Alphabet City.\"",
